    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably check with a doctor but my appointment isn't until next week and i really need this sorted before friday. i only have the one pill left and it's an old prescription. like, it's just one small dose and my asthma is totally fine right now, i haven't even needed my inhaler in weeks. would one pill really be that much of a big deal? it'll just help me get through the presentation.",
